{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010_02_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8a8d82802a3c9aa6d1d2e3a55d2c05f822560214ec420f7fc57e1e69afdd300c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:146c5bec34d5e7758cc88fc1cd0a4c522254c57184f739f36e006c4deaee18c4",
      "text": "打烊后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77827539d623fb86037bd06613989653317cb086c408fdb148be0aa8aa25183f",
      "text": "那个，打扰了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:954860567549741c160ca097dc59ebc925d917175efa4251500e1b9830daef4b",
      "text": "哎呀，你是……落了什么东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44218352eddee928837b4d35f11907eca0d0e37ea1a2cb4390878cee6085c370",
      "text": "不是的，那个……能让我在这里……\n在Cafe Parade打工吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbafb4f458e949584299bbb229cbaf8b9c3cc32c024885f4f882021fd2f48fc2",
      "text": "我最喜欢这家店了。\n所以，我想助大家一臂之力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b4d1818a0713e40c3fb55e3cd2f0a87e85d6bb95aa4c925aa6ff882baf319a5",
      "text": "拜托了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76c010b102a8da78e4b5164a2cc41be05a2dcdfc41769cea9a552194ba2f502c",
      "text": "……太突然了，吓了我一跳呢。\n不过，你能这么说我很高兴哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a78fc9902e2a4e14ecba45fb5f4cf151adb228d51485421e277fa114a0f07bc",
      "text": "当然非常欢迎啦！东云你觉得呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:086d8aacc37a82359a49615d8b569ec4089bb01f259e6f4934d599a7041e80d5",
      "text": "这个嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a70e400c36f6e486b54d932b8784123d83266b5f45c59f374819f72981cd718",
      "text": "（对蛋糕的那种亢奋情绪虽然让人有些担忧……\n但与此同时，这份热情和相关知识是货真价实的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20f7314aca4e2b6542194b9cf690f477c57574b8a0eb612dcbdb2f326953cf47",
      "text": "（……应该会成为可靠的大堂店员吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55fbfb9325f8974195531ef14ee60b8fbf422b2142678caa0e31b8c4b54d684b",
      "text": "好的。我也赞成。\n今后就请多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7fe984b1662d37ad809c84e0bc4951366470c9602746ccf76ad8f8581908bce",
      "text": "好、好的。请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
